                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "The Ministry of Health's Drug Advisory Committee has reviewed all available treatments for cancer to update the MOH List of Subsidised Drugs in line with local clinical practice and medical advancements. As part of this review, Technology Guidances have been prepared which describe the subsidy recommendations for many cancer drugs for specific clinical conditions. The remaining treatments which have been considered by the Committee are included in this document."
                        }
                      ]
                    },
